# KiCad source files are generated and rewritten by KiCad.
# Preserve their exact bytes and line endings; do not apply Git EOL normalization.
*.kicad_pro -text
*.kicad_sch -text
*.kicad_pcb -text
*.kicad_sym -text
*.kicad_mod -text
*.kicad_wks -text
*.kicad_dru -text

# Deliberately NOT listed above, and therefore left under Git's default handling:
#   - sym-lib-table / fp-lib-table (KiCad library tables)
#   - README and other Markdown files
#   - firmware and tooling source code
# These are hand-edited as often as they are tool-written, so normal Git EOL
# handling is correct for them.
#
# Note: `-text` only disables EOL conversion. It does NOT set `binary`, so Git
# still diffs these files normally, which is the point: KiCad sources are
# human-readable s-expressions and JSON and must stay reviewable in diffs.
